# The repo root .gitignore carries `lib/` from the standard Python template (a
# distutils build dir). That pattern also matches ui/src/lib/, which would silently
# drop 36 source files — the trajectory parsers, the external-app shim — from any
# checkout while still building locally. Re-include the directory here.
!/src/lib/

node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.local
